### ScarborMusic — Playlist & Favorites API Tests
### Prerequisite: Login first

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@contentType = application/json

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 0. Auth
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "testdev@example.com",
  "password": "Test1234"
}

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1. Playlist CRUD
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 1a. Create playlist (public)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/playlists
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "My Chill Playlist",
  "description": "Songs for relaxing",
  "isPublic": true
}

### 1b. Create private playlist
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/playlists
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Private Stash",
  "isPublic": false
}

### 1c. List my playlists
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/playlists?mine=true

### 1d. List all public playlists
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/playlists

### 1e. Get playlist detail (replace PLAYLIST_ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/playlists/REPLACE_WITH_PLAYLIST_ID

### 1f. Update playlist
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/playlists/REPLACE_WITH_PLAYLIST_ID
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Updated Name",
  "description": "Updated description",
  "isPublic": true
}

### 1g. Delete playlist (soft delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/playlists/REPLACE_WITH_PLAYLIST_ID

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 2. Playlist Songs
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 2a. Add song to playlist
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/playlists/REPLACE_WITH_PLAYLIST_ID/songs
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "songId": "REPLACE_WITH_SONG_ID"
}

### Expected: 200 { "success": true, "data": { playlistId, songId, position } }

### 2b. Add duplicate song (should return 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/playlists/REPLACE_WITH_PLAYLIST_ID/songs
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "songId": "REPLACE_WITH_SONG_ID"
}

### 2c. Check if song is in playlist
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/playlists/REPLACE_WITH_PLAYLIST_ID/songs?songId=REPLACE_WITH_SONG_ID

### 2d. Reorder playlist songs
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/playlists/REPLACE_WITH_PLAYLIST_ID/songs/reorder
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "songs": [
    { "songId": "SONG_ID_1", "position": 0 },
    { "songId": "SONG_ID_2", "position": 1 },
    { "songId": "SONG_ID_3", "position": 2 }
  ]
}

### 2e. Remove song from playlist
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/playlists/REPLACE_WITH_PLAYLIST_ID/songs/REPLACE_WITH_SONG_ID

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 3. Favorites
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 3a. Favorite a song
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/favorites
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "songId": "REPLACE_WITH_SONG_ID"
}

### Expected: 201 { "success": true, "data": { id, songId, createdAt } }

### 3b. Check favorite status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/favorites/REPLACE_WITH_SONG_ID

### Expected: { "data": { "isFavorited": true, "favorite": { ... } } }

### 3c. List favorites (paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/favorites?page=1&pageSize=20

### 3d. Duplicate favorite (should return 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/favorites
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "songId": "REPLACE_WITH_SONG_ID"
}

### 3e. Unfavorite a song
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/favorites/REPLACE_WITH_SONG_ID

### Expected: 200 { "success": true, "message": "Song removed from favorites" }

### 3f. Check after unfavorite
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/favorites/REPLACE_WITH_SONG_ID

### Expected: { "data": { "isFavorited": false } }

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 4. Permission Tests
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 4a. Access someone else's private playlist (should return 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/playlists/PRIVATE_PLAYLIST_BY_OTHER_USER

### 4b. Edit someone else's playlist (should return 403)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/playlists/PLAYLIST_BY_OTHER_USER
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Hacked"
}

### 4c. Unauthenticated favorite (should return 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/favorites
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: access_token=invalid

{
  "songId": "ANY_SONG_ID"
}
